    "detailed_description": "<h1>Special Offer</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>What is your subconscious trying to tell you when you are mindlessly drawing on a piece of paper at a boring meeting? Maybe someone locked up there in the dark damp basement of ida is screaming for help and trying to break out? Should I open this door or maybe hang a couple more locks on it?<br><br>Another game from crazy indie experimenters from Dnovel studio! If, of course, it can be called a game... psychedelic visuals and philosophical reasoning.<br>Is it possible to be yourself in a world of endless copies?<br><br>- Minimalistic visual style<br>- Mini-games in the genre of &quot;hidden object&quot;<br>- Reflections on the futility of being<br>- Has the plastic world won?",
